{{Term/Store|Icy Hearty Blueshell Snail|Icy Hearty Blueshell Snails|Series, BotW|plural}} are [[Item]]s in {{BotW}}.<ref name="Inventory">{{Cite|{{Big|Icy Hearty Blueshell Snail}}<br/>It takes a skilled chef to get the meat out of this frozen hearty blueshell snail. Eating this will provide a temporary increase to your heat resistance.|Inventory|BotW}}</ref>

==Location and Uses==
Icy Hearty Blueshell Snails are a type of [[Frozen Food]], and they can be made by freezing [[Hearty Blueshell Snail]]s with a [[Freezing Climate]] or [[Cold Water]].<ref>{{Cite Guide|BotW Piggyback|page= 295}}</ref> Only a skilled chef is able to extract the meat from a Icy Hearty Blueshell Snail.<ref name="Inventory"/> Eating one will grant [[Link]] one level of [[Heat Resistance]] and restore three [[Heart]]s to his [[Life Gauge]].<ref name="Inventory"/>

